    Client->>+API: POST /search<br/>Query vector + metadata filters + top_k
    API->>+VOS: search_vectors()<br/>Intelligent engine routing
    
    VOS->>+Cache: check_query_cache(query_hash)<br/>Cache-first strategy
    Cache-->>-VOS: Cache miss (proceed with search)
    
