        VIPER->>VIPER: Two-stage search<br/>Quantized → FP32 reranking
        VIPER-->>-VOS: VIPER results
    and
        Note over SST: Row-based OLTP Engine
        VOS->>+SST: search_vectors_unified()<br/>Row-based optimization
        SST->>+Bloom: hierarchical_bloom_filter()<br/>Smart filtering
        Bloom->>Bloom: File-level filtering<br/>85% file skip rate
        Bloom->>Bloom: Block-level filtering<br/>95% block skip rate
        Bloom-->>-SST: Filtered candidates
        SST->>+Hardware: simd_distance_compute()<br/>Hardware acceleration
        Hardware->>Hardware: AVX2/AVX-512 computation<br/>Vectorized operations
        Hardware-->>-SST: Accelerated distances
        SST-->>-VOS: SST results
    end
    
    VOS->>VOS: merge_and_deduplicate()<br/>MVCC resolution + multi-tier dedup
    VOS->>VOS: rank_and_limit(top_k)<br/>Final result ranking
    
